      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the invoices are still marked as \"Uncompleted\", they should be returned to the client via postal mail."
      ],
      "justification": "Repeats the conditional logic in the source text, supporting the second branch, its guard, the condition-as-action, and the return action."
    },
    {
